# Witness: an exclusion defined by a row that is not in the exclusion table

A bundle carries a gate table, an errata table, a negative-control table and a hash table as
well as its exclusion table. The first attempt accepted any table row in a bundle whose first
cell was an EX- identifier, so any of them could launder an undefined citation.

## 7. Decision

| ID | Evidence | Review | Gate clause | Result |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| EX-77 | [MET] | [ ] | a gate clause, which is not an exclusion | Shown |

The mediation bound is recorded as EX-77.

## 9. Exclusions

| ID | Status | Exclusion |
|---|---|---|
| EX-01 | Open | The inbound half of the legacy-boundary rule is environment-conditional. |
